  "notes": [
    "Reflexive form of *acostumbrar* (to accustom); fully regular -AR verb",
    "Always followed by **a + infinitive**: *acostumbrarse a hacer algo* — to get used to doing something",
    "Past participle: *acostumbrado*",
    "Non-reflexive *acostumbrar a* = to be in the habit of: *Acostumbro a levantarme temprano* — I usually get up early",
    "Related: *estar acostumbrado/a a* = to be used to (*Ya estoy acostumbrado al frío* — I'm already used to the cold)"
  ],
